er/value "3x-2w" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0a1d37be-3fa0-59b9-bd20-4310f8e5627e" :answer/id #uuid "0a1d37be-3fa0-59b9-bd20-4310f8e5627e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3x-2w+1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d3532fcf-148d-5c02-9530-dfe46187e43d" :answer/id #uuid "d3532fcf-148d-5c02-9530-dfe46187e43d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3x-2‖w‖" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-dd3e8051-4283-52b3-93e7-0409ffbc90da" :answer/id #uuid "dd3e8051-4283-52b3-93e7-0409ffbc90da" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3x-w" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-588514db-1798-58bb-9d0c-b764080a8b2c" :answer/id #uuid "588514db-1798-58bb-9d0c-b764080a8b2c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x-w" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-1203c4f3-0f74-5bfe-84b7-69d8fde66e20" :question/id #uuid "1203c4f3-0f74-5bfe-84b7-69d8fde66e20" :question/math-academy-id "q-275971" :question/problem "Given the function \n\n$$\nf(x,w)={w}^{T}x-4‖w{‖}^{2}-10\n$$\n\nthat maps two vectors to a scalar, find ${∇}_{w}f.$" :question/worked-solution "Using the results \n\n$$\n{∇}_{w}({w}^{T}x)=x,\\,{∇}_{w}({w}^{T}w)=2w,\n$$\n\nwe have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∇}_{w}f & ={∇}_{w}({w}^{T}x-4‖w{‖}^{2}-10) \\\\  & ={∇}_{w}({w}^{T}x)-4\\cdot {∇}_{w}(‖w{‖}^{2})-{∇}_{w}(10) \\\\  & ={∇}_{w}({w}^{T}x)-4\\cdot {∇}_{w}({w}^{T}w)-{∇}_{w}(10) \\\\  & =x-4\\cdot 2w+0 \\\\  & =x-8w.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-903b2b43-e629-5769-9804-0d3b19dd3c0a"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-903b2b43-e629-5769-9804-0d3b19dd3c0a" :answer-field/id #uuid "903b2b43-e629-5769-9804-0d3b19dd3c0a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-6f416802-94d1-53db-9271-9cf7d10be861" :answer-field/choices ["answer-875c69ac-9961-5045-bacf-9f0ddd624bfb" "answer-ea3853c7-a0f9-5b