ion.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-069ca6b9-1065-527d-9439-6d0d2dc19a6f"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-069ca6b9-1065-527d-9439-6d0d2dc19a6f" :answer-field/id #uuid "069ca6b9-1065-527d-9439-6d0d2dc19a6f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-2bd2e5ee-b76f-520f-84c9-af1e8bcd6860" :answer-field/choices ["answer-6ee0c7f8-2f47-540f-b5d4-0d2509ab1dfe" "answer-2bd2e5ee-b76f-520f-84c9-af1e8bcd6860" "answer-25c2a063-df9f-56e6-b378-7e460f0097d8" "answer-f52f1330-56f8-57f5-9aec-bd2be7bf70d2" "answer-854198e2-9a62-52ea-bf0c-45c3e1e8db91"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6ee0c7f8-2f47-540f-b5d4-0d2509ab1dfe" :answer/id #uuid "6ee0c7f8-2f47-540f-b5d4-0d2509ab1dfe" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\,\\text{sign}(w)-w" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2bd2e5ee-b76f-520f-84c9-af1e8bcd6860" :answer/id #uuid "2bd2e5ee-b76f-520f-84c9-af1e8bcd6860" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\text{sign}(w)-2w" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-25c2a063-df9f-56e6-b378-7e460f0097d8" :answer/id #uuid "25c2a063-df9f-56e6-b378-7e460f0097d8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\text{sign}(w)-2‖w‖" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f52f1330-56f8-57f5-9aec-bd2be7bf70d2" :answer/id #uuid "f52f1330-56f8-57f5-9aec-bd2be7bf70d2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\text{sign}(w)-w" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-854198e2-9a62-52ea-bf0c-45c3e1e8db91" :answer/id #uuid "854198e2-9a62-52ea-bf0c-45c3e1e8db91" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "‖w{‖}_{1}\\cdot \\text{sign}(w)-2w" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-7dc41e95-539c-50b9-8fb0-b63764e8684c" :question/id #uuid "7dc41e95-539c-50b9-8fb0-b63764e8684c" :question/math-academy-id "q-275978" :question/problem "Given the function \n\n$$\nf(x,w)={(‖w{‖}_{1})}^{3}-4{x}^{T}w\n$$\n\nthat maps a vector to a scalar, find ${∇}_{w}f.$ You may assume that $w$ has no zero components." :question/worked-solution "Using the results\n\n$$\n{∇}_{w}(‖w{‖}_{1})=\\text{sign}(w),\\,{∇}_{w}({x}^{T}w)=x,\n$$\n\n we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∇}_{w}f & ={∇}_{w}({(‖w{‖}_{1})}^{3}-4{x}^{T}w) \\\\  & ={∇}_{w}({(‖w{‖}_{1})}^{3})-{∇}_{w}(4{x}^{T}w) \\\\  & ={∇}_{w}({(‖w{‖}_{1})}^{3})-4\\cdot {∇}_{w}({x}^{T}w) \\\\  & =3(‖w{‖}_{1})^{2}\\cdot {∇}_{w}(‖w{‖}_{1})-4\\cdot x \\\\  & =3(‖w{‖}_{1})^{2}\\cdot \\text{sign}(w)-4\\cdot x \\\\  & =3(‖w{‖}_{1})^{2}\\cdot \\text{sign}(w)-4x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-e5042304-8241-5082-82cb-26bee7d6fc07"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-e5042304-8241-5082-82cb-26bee7d6fc07" :answer-field/id #uuid "e5042304-8241-5082-82cb-26bee7d6fc07" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-bd827637-7b44-5716-8016-3b379e1ce6d6" :answer-field/choices ["answer-ca5a0474-5015-51cb-829b-d6477c15697d" "answer-e7e63be3-9e49-5062-b7d5-c7b2c1a4ae27" "answer-bd827637-7b44-5716-8016-3b379e1ce6d6" "answer-9fb156c9-d84f-5baa-add4-3f456c7cf40a" "answer-b5ef1186-89a0-5fdf-84b4-0d9057dc9b7d"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ca5a0474-5015-51cb-829b-d6477c15697d" :answer/id #uuid "ca5a0474-5015-51cb-829b-d6477c15697d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(‖w{‖}_{1})^{2}\\cdot \\text{sign}(w)-4x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e7e63be3-9e49-5062-b7d5-c7b2c1a4ae27" :answer/id #uuid "e7e63be3-9e49-5062-b7d5-c7b2c1a4ae27" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3(‖w{‖}_{1})^{2}\\cdot \\text{sign}(w)-4w" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-bd827637-7b44-5716-8016-3b379e1ce6d6" :answer/id #uuid "bd827637-7b44-5716-8016-3b379e1ce6d6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3(‖w{‖}_{1})^{2}\\cdot \\text{sign}(w)-4x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answe