sum }_{j=1}^{n}\\boxed{}\\,Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\n$$\n\nwhere $Δ{x}_{i}={x}_{i}-{x}_{i-1}$ and $Δ{y}_{j}={y}_{j}-{y}_{j-1},$ what is the missing expression in the double summation above?" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186393521 :question/problem "Let $R=[1,7]\\times [-3,-1]$ be a region in the $xy$-plane, and let $f(x,y)=9-2x-6y.$\nFurther, let $P$ be a partition of $R,$ where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{P}_{1}=\\{{x}_{0},{x}_{1},…,{x}_{m}\\},\\,{P}_{2}=\\{{y}_{0},{y}_{1},…,{y}_{n}\\},\\,P={P}_{1}\\times {P}_{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nGiven that the lower Riemann sum of $f$ with respect to $P$ is given by\n\n$$\nL(f,P)={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}\\boxed{}\\,Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\n$$\n\nwhere $Δ{x}_{i}={x}_{i}-{x}_{i-1}$ and $Δ{y}_{j}={y}_{j}-{y}_{j-1},$ what is the missing expression in the double summation above?" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186345074 :question/problem "Let $R=[2,3]\\times [0,1]$ be a region in the $xy$-plane, and let $f(x,y)=50-4{x}^{2}-11{y}^{2}.$\nFurther, let $P$ be a partition of $R,$ where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{P}_{1}=\\{{x}_{0},{x}_{1},…,{x}_{m}\\},\\,{P}_{2}=\\{{y}_{0},{y}_{1},…,{y}_{n}\\},\\,P={P}_{1}\\times {P}_{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nGiven that the lower Riemann sum of $f$ with respect to $P$ is given by\n\n$$\nL(f,P)={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}\\boxed{}\\,Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\n$$\n\nwhere $Δ{x}_{i}={x}_{i}-{x}_{i-1}$ and $Δ{y}_{j}={y}_{j}-{y}_{j-1},$ what is the missing expression in the double summation above?" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "question-086ea7e4-b45d-5b48-92bf-b7fd8532a3af" :question/id #uuid "086ea7e4-b45d-5b48-92bf-b7fd8532a3af" :question/math-academy-id "q-164125" :question/problem "Let $R=[2,4]\\times [1,2]$ be a region in the $xy$-plane, and let $f(x,y)=16-2x-y.$\nFurther, let $P$ be a partition of $R,$ where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{P}_{1}=\\{{x}_{0},{x}_{1},…,{x}_{m}\\},\\,{P}_{2}=\\{{y}_{0},{y}_{1},…,{y}_{n}\\},\\,P={P}_{1}\\times {P}_{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nGiven that the lower Riemann sum of $f$ with respect to $P$ is given by\n\n$$\nL(f,P)={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}\\boxed{}\\,Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\n$$\n\nwhere $Δ{x}_{i}={x}_{i}-{x}_{i-1}$ and $Δ{y}_{j}={y}_{j}-{y}_{j-1},$ what is the missing expression in the double summation above?" :question/worked-solution "The lower Riemann sum is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}{m}_{ij}Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${m}_{ij}$ is the *minimum* value of $f$ in each subregion ${R}_{ij}.$ \n\nWe consider an arbitrary subregion ${R}_{ij}$ of the partition. This subregion lies between ${x}_{i-1}$ and ${x}_{i}$ over the $x$-axis and ${y}_{i-1}$ and ${y}_{i}$ over the $y$-axis, as shown below. \n\n![](images/88/88ffe30ae5401e00502b35d851b216768aad69bf94236561617adf23e1ce058f.png)\n\nNotice that:\n\n- $f(x,y)=16-2x-y$ decreases as $x$ increases, and\n\n- $f(x,y)=16-2x-y$ decreases as $y$ increases.\n\n![](images/ce/ce0d90127e1f14654f4b32a933f1eb6e76e054c03f19ca40c3f04116aa3c2c93.png)\n\nAs a result, the *minimum* value of $f$ in each subregion is attained when we have the *largest* possible $x$ and the *largest* possible $y.$ This is the value at the *top right corner* of each subregion. \n\n![](images/4a/4a10c8332a5f346d393c37531c13db6aa69d4cecb241efd7c34d57f32d5a98b8.png)\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{m}_{ij} & =f({x}_{i},{y}_{j})=16-2{x}_{i}-{y}_{j}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nfor all $1\\le i\\le m$ and $1\\le j\\le n.$\n\nFinally, the lower Riemann sum is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L(f,P) & ={\\sum }_{i=1}^{m}{\\sum }_{j=1}^{n}(16-{x}_{i}-{y}_{j})Δ{x}_{i}Δ{y}_{j}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the missing expression is $16-2{x}_{i}-{y}_{j}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-fe767b7b-e724-5de1-8c65-84a86b708adc"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-fe767b7b-e724-5de1-8c65-84a86b708adc" :answer-field/id #uuid "fe767b7b-e724-5de1-8c65-84a86b708adc" :answer-field/