 reduced. The expression \n\n$$\n\\frac{y+7}{2}\n$$\n\n is already in lowest terms." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-14ca4ca3-7691-512c-85eb-f0066033427d"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-14ca4ca3-7691-512c-85eb-f0066033427d" :answer-field/id #uuid "14ca4ca3-7691-512c-85eb-f0066033427d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-92bafb7f-8df7-5a5a-ac4f-c44d17f13b23" :answer-field/choices ["answer-92714b1c-73df-5cd9-bda2-319955713386" "answer-953401bf-6708-5a4f-883e-0a1a934a55b8" "answer-92bafb7f-8df7-5a5a-ac4f-c44d17f13b23" "answer-1331700c-a58b-557d-bb0f-6b79ad2201d4" "answer-53177f4b-cc3e-572f-aa82-509eb51e87dd"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-92714b1c-73df-5cd9-bda2-319955713386" :answer/id #uuid "92714b1c-73df-5cd9-bda2-319955713386" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{-y+7}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-953401bf-6708-5a4f-883e-0a1a934a55b8" :answer/id #uuid "953401bf-6708-5a4f-883e-0a1a934a55b8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{y+6}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-92bafb7f-8df7-5a5a-ac4f-c44d17f13b23" :answer/id #uuid "92bafb7f-8df7-5a5a-ac4f-c44d17f13b23" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{y+7}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1331700c-a58b-557d-bb0f-6b79ad2201d4" :answer/id #uuid "1331700c-a58b-557d-bb0f-6b79ad2201d4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{y+7}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-53177f4b-cc3e-572f-aa82-509eb51e87dd" :answer/id #uuid "53177f4b-cc3e-572f-aa82-509eb51e87dd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{y-7}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186073895 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-c2d93ca7-606b-5dec-9244-b98215ef5117"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-c2d93ca7-606b-5dec-9244-b98215ef5117" :question/id #uuid "c2d93ca7-606b-5dec-9244-b98215ef5117" :question/math-academy-id "q-59913" :question/problem "| $5$ | $10$ |\n| --- | --- |\n| $?$ | $30$ |\n| $25$ | $50$ |\n\n$$\n\n$$\n\nWhat number is missing from the ratio table?" :question/worked-solution "We start with the ratio $5:10$ and write it as a fraction:\n\n$$\n\\frac{5}{10}\n$$\n\nSo the numerator represents the left-hand entry ($5$), and the denominator represents the right-hand entry ($10$).\n\nWe can make a denominator of $30$ by multiplying the numerator and denominator by $3$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{5\\times 3}{10\\times 3} & =\\frac{15}{30}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe add this to our ratio table:\n\n| $5$ | $10$ |\n| --- | --- |\n| $15$ | $30$ |\n| $25$ | $50$ |\n\n$$\n\n$$\n\nSo, the missing number is $15.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-54429781-1dbd-5d47-83f8-be45001382bc"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-54429781-1dbd-5d47-83f8-be45001382bc" :answer-field/id #uuid "54429781-1dbd-5d47-83f8-be45001382bc" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-e48f2efa-9d00-5726-a013-c72aec000ba8" :answer-field/choices ["answer-3b01fea7-f7fa-510d-ada5-b82cd59c7c97" "answer-6b4bca87-c481-5fd5-9cce-cf8c4bd1e0ff" "answer-e48f2efa-9d00-5726-a013-c72aec000ba8" "answer-dd412dbe-d361-5562-a98f-07652bbbe12d" "answer-ed7182da-9af1-58b7-982b-7defc37824ef"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3b01fea7-f7fa-510d-ada5-b82cd59c7c97" :answer/id #uuid "3b01fea7-f7fa-510d-ada5-b82cd59c7c97" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6b4bca87-c481-5fd5-9cce-cf8c4bd1e0ff" :answer/id #uuid "6b4bca87-c481-5fd5-9cce-cf8c4bd1e0ff" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "12" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e48f2efa-9d00-5726-a013-c72aec000ba8" :answer/id #uuid "e48f2efa-9d00-5726-a013-c7