e numerator and the denominator to the power of $4:$\n\n$$\n{(-\\frac{2}{3})}^{4}={(\\frac{(-2)}{3})}^{4}=\\frac{(-2)^{4}}{{3}^{4}}\n$$\n\nNow, using $(-2)^{4}=16$ and ${3}^{4}=81,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{(-2)^{4}}{{3}^{4}}=\\frac{16}{81}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-2c6a5509-5ce2-50bc-ada9-2d5121a407c2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-2c6a5509-5ce2-50bc-ada9-2d5121a407c2" :answer-field/id #uuid "2c6a5509-5ce2-50bc-ada9-2d5121a407c2" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-98102fa6-60fa-5c9e-a3d6-b1c5223c3f16" :answer-field/choices ["answer-fae39428-4f93-5219-a733-bb8b7cbb74a8" "answer-be6a372e-767d-5043-93bc-06652273b513" "answer-98102fa6-60fa-5c9e-a3d6-b1c5223c3f16" "answer-2e6c5baf-6923-5afe-bd84-66fa2b5ce9c2" "answer-283aec17-150c-5d77-97de-8e2a579c1b9c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-fae39428-4f93-5219-a733-bb8b7cbb74a8" :answer/id #uuid "fae39428-4f93-5219-a733-bb8b7cbb74a8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{16}{27}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-be6a372e-767d-5043-93bc-06652273b513" :answer/id #uuid "be6a372e-767d-5043-93bc-06652273b513" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{8}{81}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-98102fa6-60fa-5c9e-a3d6-b1c5223c3f16" :answer/id #uuid "98102fa6-60fa-5c9e-a3d6-b1c5223c3f16" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{16}{81}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2e6c5baf-6923-5afe-bd84-66fa2b5ce9c2" :answer/id #uuid "2e6c5baf-6923-5afe-bd84-66fa2b5ce9c2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{27}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-283aec17-150c-5d77-97de-8e2a579c1b9c" :answer/id #uuid "283aec17-150c-5d77-97de-8e2a579c1b9c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{8}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "activity-5780162d-